# ⚠️ This repository is deprecated

The backend that lived here has been consolidated into the Next.js
application in **[my-expenses-website](https://github.com/yaniv120892/my-expenses-website)**,
which now serves both the frontend and the API from a single codebase.

What moved:

- All API routes are now Next.js route handlers under `src/app/api/`
- Business logic lives in `src/server/` (services, repositories, integrations)
- The Prisma schema and all migrations moved to `prisma/` — database
  migrations MUST be run from my-expenses-website from now on
- Vercel cron jobs (scheduled transactions, daily summary, backups,
  subscription detection/audit) are declared in that repo's `vercel.json`
- The Telegram bot webhook, AI chat assistant, and excel-extraction
  webhook all live there as well

Do not deploy from this repository. It is kept only for git history.
